course: dictionary
lesson: 6141
title: A word from the farm
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Look at the word itself first. Milkmaid is two smaller words joined together: milk and maid. A milkmaid is a girl or woman who milks cows, so the word tells you the job.
explain: The sentence around the word gives more clues. «In 1796 Edward Jenner noticed that milkmaids who caught mild cowpox didn't get deadly smallpox.» Milkmaids worked with cows every day, and cowpox is an illness of cows, so the context fits the meaning you already found.
explain: Milkmaid is an old-fashioned word. You will mostly meet it in history books, old stories and nursery rhymes, such as «The Milkmaid and Her Pail». When you meet a word like this, check the clues and then try your meaning in the sentence to see if it fits.
fact: A milkmaid is a girl or woman who milks cows by hand or works in a dairy.
fact: «Milkmaid» is an old-use word, so you will find it mostly in history, stories and rhymes.
fact: In the 1790s, the doctor Edward Jenner noticed that milkmaids who caught cowpox did not catch smallpox.
fact: That discovery led to the first vaccine.
fact: «The Milkmaid and Her Pail» is a fable that teaches you not to count your chickens before they hatch.
exercise: What is a milkmaid? | A doctor who studies cows | A cow that gives a lot of milk | *A girl or woman who milks cows by hand | A large machine that works on a farm
exercise: «The Milkmaid and Her Pail» is a fable. What does it teach? | Always carry a pail with two hands | Milking cows is easy work | *Do not count your chickens before they hatch | Stories should always be true
exercise: Which two smaller words make up milkmaid? | bread and maid | *milk and maid | pail and maid | cow and pail
exercise: «In 1796 Edward Jenner noticed that milkmaids who caught mild cowpox didn't get deadly smallpox.» According to this sentence, what did the milkmaids not get? | a milk pail | *smallpox | cowpox | a cold
test: According to the sentence, which discovery led to the first vaccine? | A new machine made milk faster | Cows learned to read | *Milkmaids who caught cowpox did not catch smallpox | Milkmaids learned to fly
test: Which word in «the milkmaids who caught mild cowpox» tells you that cowpox is linked to cows? | milkmaids | mild | *cowpox | caught
exam: Which job does the word milkmaid describe? | a builder of farm machines | a doctor | a teacher of history | *a girl or woman who milks cows
